                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kwape ajaatar amamus ailakec, ido kwape ajaar adiakarikee, kwape kwaŋin abu keswamak kes; kebwa akakonyen kamakec.",
