        },
        {
          "text": " “Kanuka mm inera kwanata Ejakait EDEKE ebe: Enyakuni kwana aijoreorio naka Yakob, etimi ekek kere loka Isirael; ido kerumi ekokote kanuka ekakiror lokalaunan. ",
